    "deepdive_title": "Show photos with absolute freedom: no copies, no screenshots, total control",
    "deepdive_intro": "XowApp lets you show your photos and videos to the people you choose with complete peace of mind. What enters XowApp never leaves XowApp: no one can save them to their camera roll, forward them, or share them outside.",
