    "transparencia_phase_infra_name": "Phase 2 · Infrastructure",
    "transparencia_phase_infra_desc": "More storage and transfer as the community grows, monitoring tools and redundancy so a failure never turns into data loss. Goal: 24 months of upgraded infrastructure.",
    "transparencia_phase_pro_name": "Phase 3 · Getting formal",
