    "admin_dashboard_placeholder": "ستكون أدوات الإدارة (المصروفات، حالة التمويل) هنا. حاليًا، هذا يؤكد فقط أن الوصول يعمل.",
    "analogies_kicker": "Privacy made simple",
    "analogies_title": "Four simple examples to understand how it works",
    "analogies_intro": "Behind XowApp is advanced technology, but understanding why your photos and videos are 100% safe is as simple as these four everyday examples:",
    "analogy_bouncer_badge": "1. Access & Anonymity",
    "analogy_bouncer_title": "The nightclub bouncer",
    "analogy_bouncer_body": "Why do we use Google Sign-In if we promise absolute anonymity? Imagine hiring a bouncer for your party and telling him: \"Check the ID of anyone who wants to enter to make sure they aren't a bot or malicious; if it's valid, let them in.\" Once that person steps inside, you don't know who they are: you don't have their name, ID number, or address; you only know they are a legitimate guest. In XowApp, Google is merely that bouncer at the door: it validates entry, but inside we never know who you are or store your personal data.",
    "analogy_locks_badge": "2. Device-to-Device Encryption",
    "analogy_locks_title": "The padlock factory and your unique key",
    "analogy_locks_body": "On XowApp you don't need to trust us for your photos to be safe. Every user holds a secret key inside their phone's secure vault. It's as if you gave your friends a machine that produces open padlocks that can only be unlocked with your key. When someone wants to show you a photo, they put it inside a strongbox and lock it with your padlock. From that instant, no intermediaries, servers, or even XowApp can open it. You are the only person on earth with the key to unlock that box.",
    "analogy_mailbox_badge": "3. XowApp and its cloud",
    "analogy_mailbox_title": "XowApp and its cloud: a blind, temporary drop box",
    "analogy_mailbox_body": "If XowApp believes your photos should stay on your devices, why do we use the cloud? Quite simply: because when you send a photo, the recipient's phone might be switched off, out of coverage, or offline. XowApp's cloud exists solely as a temporary delivery drop box. Furthermore, whatever travels through and temporarily rests in the cloud is heavily encrypted: absolutely no one in the world except the intended recipient with their private key can view or decrypt the content (not hackers, not server providers, not even XowApp). And unlike other services, our cloud is never a permanent warehouse: the exact second the recipient collects and downloads the photo to their phone, the file is completely and irreversibly purged from our servers. Zero trace in the cloud.",
    "analogy_screenphoto_badge": "4. Taking a photo of the screen",
    "analogy_screenphoto_title": "The inevitable question: What if someone takes a photo of the screen with another phone?",
    "analogy_screenphoto_body": "Let's be completely honest: no software on earth can physically prevent someone from picking up a second phone and pointing a camera at your screen (even though XowApp includes active techniques to make this difficult). So why does what XowApp does matter so much? In standard messaging apps, violating your privacy is far too easy: just tap \"Forward\" or \"Save to gallery\" in a split second without even thinking. In XowApp, that ease is gone. With no downloads, no screenshots, and no share button, anyone wanting to circulate your photo has to deliberately find another device, frame the screen, and end up with a degraded image. But the physical hurdle isn't even the main point: it makes self-deception impossible. Anyone who goes through the effort of photographing a screen knows without excuse that they are breaching your trust and doing something forbidden. Instead of making impossible promises against the laws of physics, XowApp makes the most fundamental principle crystal clear: if a photo isn't yours, it isn't yours to share.",
    "how_cta_prompt": "إذا كنت ترغب في معرفة المزيد حول كيفية حماية صورك خطوة بخطوة:",
    "how_cta_deepdive": "شاهد كيف يعمل",
    "deepdive_kicker": "كيف يعمل XowApp",
    "deepdive_title": "اعرض الصور بحرية تامة: لا نسخ، لا لقطات شاشة، تحكم كامل",
    "deepdive_intro": "يتيح لك XowApp إظهار صورك ومقاطع الفيديو للأشخاص الذين تختارهم براحة بال تامة. ما يدخل XowApp لا يغادره أبدًا: لا يمكن لأحد حفظها في معرض الصور أو إعادة توجيهها أو مشاركتها بالخارج.",
    "deepdive_concept_showing_title": "العرض مقابل المشاركة",
    "deepdive_concept_showing_body": "في تطبيقات المراسلة ووسائل التواصل التقليدية، يعني إرسال الصورة التخلي عن نسخة رقمية وقبول شروط غامضة حول المحتوى الخاص بك. في XowApp، نحاكي الفعل الطبيعي للعرض: مثل السماح لشخص ما بالنظر إلى ألبوم في يدك. ينظرون، لكن الألبوم يبقى ملكك. لا يمكن لـ XowApp رؤية صورك أو رسائلك، وتم حظر لقطات الشاشة والتنزيل، وتحتفظ بالتحكم الكامل في جميع الأوقات.",
    "deepdive_concept_albums_title": "الألبومات الخاصة والجماعية: المالك يبقى متحكمًا",
    "deepdive_concept_albums_body": "أنشئ ألبومات خاصة لشخصين أو ألبومات جماعية مع العائلة والأصدقاء. من يرفع الصورة يبقى المالك الوحيد لها: إذا قررت حذفها في أي وقت، يتم مسحها فورًا من أجهزة جميع الأعضاء.",
    "deepdive_concept_social_title": "تفاعلات ودردشة خاصة 100%",
    "deepdive_concept_social_body": "علّق وتفاعل وتحدث داخل كل ألبوم. يتم تشفير جميع التعليقات والإعجابات والرسائل تشفيرًا تامًا بين الطرفين ولا يمكن رؤيتها إلا لأعضاء الألبوم المصرح لهم.",
    "deepdive_concept_security_title": "مجهولية مطلقة بالتصميم وبيئة معزولة",
    "deepdive_concept_security_body": "لا نعرف هويتك ولا نملك أي طريقة لمعرفتها. يتم تخزين صورك في بيئة معزولة خاصة على هاتفك، مع إمكانية القفل البيومتري. لا يمكن للتطبيقات الأخرى ولا لخوادمنا الوصول إلى محتواك.",
